{
  attr Bounds = <900,10,1340,440>;
}

// These are variants of the font and bitmap resources to match the screen size of \
// 480x272 pixel. 
// 
// The variants of the constants are necessary to adapt the layout of the climate \
// cabinet within a screen of 480x272 pixel.
// 
// As soon as the variant condition is fulfilled, these variants are used within \
// the application.
